<div><b><font size="4">Morphology</font></b></div>
<div>LÃ¡adan has an <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agglutinative_language">agglutinative</a> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morphology_(linguistics)">morphology</a>, and uses a number of <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Affix">affixes</a> to indicate various feelings and moods that many <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natural_language">natural languages</a> can only indicate by tone of voice, <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Body_language">body language</a> or circumlocution.</div>
